{"title":"Hancock Spruce Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eDeck the Halls with the Hancock Spruce Artificial Christmas Tree\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe Hancock Spruce artificial Christmas tree collection from Carol's Christmas Conifers delivers the classic holiday look you know and love, crafted for easy setup, lasting durability, and timeless style. With its traditional full-bodied silhouette, lush PVC branch tips, and deep green foliage, the Hancock Spruce brings warm, familiar Christmas charm to any home. Whether you are decorating a cozy living room or looking for a reliable tree that looks great year after year, the Hancock Spruce is a dependable choice built to last.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eAvailable in both full and pencil silhouettes, the Hancock Spruce is designed to fit a variety of spaces — from open living rooms to tighter corners, hallways, and apartments where a narrower profile works best.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\"\u003eWhy choose the Hancock Spruce?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe Hancock Spruce is ideal for those who love the classic look of a traditional Christmas tree. Its lush PVC branch construction creates a full, well-shaped tree that holds \u003ca title=\"Christmas Ornaments\" href=\"/\/collections\/christmas-ornaments\"\u003eornaments\u003c\/a\u003e, \u003ca title=\"Christmas Ribbons\" href=\"/\/collections\/ribbons\"\u003eribbon\u003c\/a\u003e, and decorative garland with ease. It is a reliable, low-maintenance option that sets up quickly, looks consistently great, and stores cleanly season after season — making it a go-to choice for anyone who simply wants a beautiful tree without the fuss.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\"\u003eShould I choose the full or pencil Hancock Spruce?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe Hancock Spruce collection is available in both full and pencil silhouettes to suit different spaces and decorating preferences.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe full Hancock Spruce provides a wide, traditional Christmas tree shape with generous branch spread and plenty of room for ornaments, ribbon, and garland. It is best suited for larger living rooms or open spaces where a bold, classic tree can take center stage.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe pencil Hancock Spruce offers the same lush PVC foliage and traditional styling in a slim, upright profile. It is a great option for apartments, narrow rooms, hallways, or any space where a full-width tree feels oversized without giving up the look of a full, well-decorated Christmas tree.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eIs the Hancock Spruce available pre-lit or unlit?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe Hancock Spruce collection is available in both pre-lit and unlit options to accommodate your decorating preferences.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eOur pre-lit Hancock Spruce artificial Christmas trees feature professionally installed lighting that delivers a warm, even glow throughout the tree. With Power Pole Technology, setup is effortless — no tangled cords, no complicated connections. Simply assemble, connect, and your tree lights up instantly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eHow long does it take to shape the Hancock Spruce?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eLike most 100% PVC artificial Christmas trees, the Hancock Spruce benefits from a dedicated shaping session when you first set it up. Plan to spend approximately 1–3 hours working through the branches, separating, fanning, and positioning each tip by hand to build out the fullness of the tree.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe effort is worth it. Once properly shaped, the Hancock Spruce should look completely full and lush from top to bottom, giving you a beautifully finished tree that often surprises people with how full it can get. Many of our customers find that after the first season, the branches hold their shape and subsequent setups take significantly less time.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThink of the initial shaping session as a one-time investment. Put on your favorite holiday playlist, pour yourself something warm, and enjoy the process!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\"\u003eIs the Hancock Spruce easy to assemble and store?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eYes. The Hancock Spruce is designed for quick setup, easy storage, and reliable long-term use. Its hinged branch construction allows branches to fall naturally into place during assembly, so you can get your tree up, shaped, and looking full. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eEach tree includes a sturdy stand and complimentary setup gloves to help you shape and arrange the branches during assembly. A complimentary storage bag is also included to keep the tree protected between seasons.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhen the holidays are over, the Hancock Spruce disassembles easily and stores neatly in a cool, dry place, keeping it in great condition for many seasons to come.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eExplore the full Hancock Spruce collection and find the size and style that fits your home this holiday season.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"7-foot-hancock-spruce-tree-led","title":"7' Hancock Spruce Artificial Christmas Tree 450 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eOur handcrafted Hancock Spruce mirrors the natural beauty of a Norway Spruce, capturing its rich color, full shape, and lifelike needles. With authentic details and effortless elegance, it brings the charm of a real tree into your home, creating a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642918694976,"sku":"HS-T7-L","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Hancock-Spruce.png?v=1783084872"},{"product_id":"8-foot-hancock-spruce-tree-unlit","title":"8' Hancock Spruce Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eOur handcrafted Hancock Spruce mirrors the natural beauty of a Norway Spruce, capturing its rich color, full shape, and lifelike needles. With authentic details and effortless elegance, it brings the charm of a real tree into your home, creating a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642919514176,"sku":"HS-T8-U","price":289.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Hancock2_16470dc4-5a0a-410a-a5cf-7678e43b1944.png?v=1760466971"},{"product_id":"9-foot-hancock-spruce-tree-unlit","title":"9' Hancock Spruce Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eOur handcrafted Hancock Spruce mirrors the natural beauty of a Norway Spruce, capturing its rich color, full shape, and lifelike needles. With authentic details and effortless elegance, it brings the charm of a real tree into your home, creating a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642923085888,"sku":"HS-T9-U","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Hancock2_564933af-525b-4969-aeb8-d45084f40409.png?v=1760466932"},{"product_id":"9-foot-hancock-spruce-tree-led","title":"9' Hancock Spruce Artificial Christmas Tree 750 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eOur handcrafted Hancock Spruce mirrors the natural beauty of a Norway Spruce, capturing its rich color, full shape, and lifelike needles. With authentic details and effortless elegance, it brings the charm of a real tree into your home, creating a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642923249728,"sku":"HS-T9-L","price":479.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/HancockSprucePrelit_2e6b28f1-1d7a-40a8-b3a2-a3d406f6f7b3.png?v=1760729431"},{"product_id":"8-foot-hancock-spruce-tree-led","title":"8' Hancock Spruce Artificial Christmas Tree with 550 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eOur handcrafted Hancock Spruce mirrors the natural beauty of a No